      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\nIn the name of God, the merciful, the compassionate.\n</li>\n<li>\nThe most lofty and singular lord, the firm,\n</li>\n<li>\nthe confidence, the trustworthy, pride of the viziers and greatness of the kingdom,\n</li>\n<li>\nnobility of the lofty dynasty, chosen one of the Fatimid\n</li>\n<li>\ncaliphate, crown of the true companions, venerable one of the dynasty\n</li>\n<li>\nand its loftiness, bearer of the two splendors, companion of the commander\n</li>\n<li>\nof the believers\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
